    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1191_SC10R0112_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: Professor, you still enjoy\n",
        "the enthusiasm kids bring to\\fyour research, don’t you?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1191_SC10R0112_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, step this way,\n",
